      "value": "I think this update was pretty good. If you want an avatar you can clone it off of people that have cloning enabled. If people are interested in the avatar world that avatar came from they will go there. Its that simple.\nIf people had the option to make it \"pedestal only\" im 100% sure half of avatar worlds, if not all popular ones will disable cloning making the option useless.",
