  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I believe this would be an amazing way for commissioners also animators to get back in business because no one wants their model stolen without permission.. This updated took me by surprise because doing this made allot of map creators take down there maps because no one was going to them anymore and it was making them unpopular so they completely lost effort into updating the world\n\nReason why it should be fixed like this\n\n1: MAP creators will need this if they want people to stop by their world.. Join a discord do commissions ext.\n\n2: Would also be good to help your friends with avatars without paying for them because if you also set a friend toggle for cloning would be an amazing feature so people that put more time into making avatars could help out close ones.\n\n3: I don't understand how this was a good idea.. my opinion this is just a VRCheat you put into the game because that's exactly how it was before...(Some people do not know when cloning is on and when their avatar is taken they can't do anything about it and then it gets spread everywhere) well of course you can just set it private again but what about those who don't have the avatar files and had it uploaded....(I know you could just tell the person who made it to set it private or why would you make it public? well I'm just getting off topic...\n\nwell I may have gotten off topic but I still think the system with Clone Pedestal Optional to friends and private worlds or public would be an amazing feature to the game.. I would have put bug reports on this canny because this update was not needed.. \n\nPS: Shak in da wauta mate.. Donde esta la leche",
